From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Accept TV commands from Tasker while connected

Let a package-targeted broadcast send a supported TV button over the
active Bluetooth HID connection when the user enables Tasker control.
Share the press and release path with the notification and widget.

